                        "form": "kibitzing"
                    },
                    {
                        "form_id": "7b80207e-6b58-4540-831c-92278a5be515",
                        "entry_id": "31ffb4bb-27e7-3486-b991-2a2c12a61a3f",
                        "tags": [
                            "participle",
                            "past"
                        ],
                        "form": "kibitzed"
                    },
                    {
                        "form_id": "a40432e8-ea61-4d8d-8eab-8ea474595299",
                        "entry_id": "31ffb4bb-27e7-3486-b991-2a2c12a61a3f",
                        "tags": [
                            "past"
                        ],
                        "form": "kibitzed"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "70e3c773-b12e-3cd3-8f12-84ccef744260",
                        "entry_id": "31ffb4bb-27e7-3486-b991-2a2c12a61a3f",
                        "glosses": [
                            "To make small talk or idle chatter."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "intransitive"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "b4ec4956-e7d6-4d14-935c-f8c25e03701c",
                                "sense_id": "70e3c773-b12e-3cd3-8f12-84ccef744260",
                                "text": "Louise and I used to head down to the coffee shop and just sit for hours and kibitz."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "5b8292e3-45bb-4db2-ba3d-1c2b8d4c8441",
                                "sense_id": "70e3c773-b12e-3cd3-8f12-84ccef744260",
                                "text": "His wife Karen listened as John and I kibitzed about our experiences at the University of Oklahoma some 40 years ago."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "5817ec05-37e4-4721-97f2-c497e76659dc",
                                "sense_id": "70e3c773-b12e-3cd3-8f12-84ccef744260",
                                "text": "Okay, we kibitzed enough. What brings you?"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "084f8089-9f88-436b-93d2-2e7e8ddd5488",
                                "sense_id": "70e3c773-b12e-3cd3-8f12-84ccef744260",
                                "text": "Their owners lounge at the outdoor tables, kibitzing about cranksets, aero bars, local races or, when they can help it, anything other than cycling."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "828806da-3f72-4ba7-9d81-a3a576c66422",
                                "sense_id": "70e3c773-b12e-3cd3-8f12-84ccef744260",
                                "text": "So how it’s gonna go is we’re gonna talk for about 45 minutes. We’re just gonna kibbitz here; that’s Yiddish for just kinda like […]"
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "3a862e29-f862-3f65-93a5-a9297dc6b1c4",
                        "entry_id": "31ffb4bb-27e7-3486-b991-2a2c12a61a3f",
                        "glosses": [
                            "To give unsolicited or unwanted advice or make unhelpful or idle comments, especially to someone playing a game."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "intransitive"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "129c1261-c146-4d02-b5de-257c4aa3fe62",
                                "sense_id": "3a862e29-f862-3f65-93a5-a9297dc6b1c4",
                                "text": "Quit kibitzing! You're giving away my hand!"
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "52af98c5-c45a-35cf-9ebc-6ca30e121ed1",
                        "entry_id": "31ffb4bb-27e7-3486-b991-2a2c12a61a3f",
                        "glosses": [
                            "To watch a card or board game."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "intransitive",
                            "transitive"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "7b14e0ba-70f7-4ff1-98e8-cafc88fd8e03",
                                "sense_id": "52af98c5-c45a-35cf-9ebc-6ca30e121ed1",
                                "text": "[…] stayed in the dorm, although she lived in Brooklyn Heights, and I frequently spent long hours with her, either in her room or at the student lounge, where we drank coffee and smoked cigarettes and kibitzed the never-ending bridge game."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "363fc951-b57a-478e-932b-0ee13b5a807e",
                                "sense_id": "52af98c5-c45a-35cf-9ebc-6ca30e121ed1",
                                "text": "When it was my turn to stay in the office until 11 pm. closing, I kibitzed on their poker games and heard some colorful tales."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "d1603ad2-16c4-42e6-8735-53bdd7060b4f",
                        "source_entry_id": "31ffb4bb-27e7-3486-b991-2a2c12a61a3f",
                        "source_sense_description": "chit-chat",
                        "target_lang_word": "roddelen",
                        "target_lang_code": "nl",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "roddelen",
                                "target_lang_code": "nl",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "7691ff4d-9389-3ab9-8dcd-5a95e464aa13",
                                        "entry_id": "0b7e0d44-28b1-315b-a3bd-a272eda2add7",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "op een vervelende manier over anderen praten"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c98c550d-97b3-4497-a937-586f5a9cc10a",
                                                "sense_id": "7691ff4d-9389-3ab9-8dcd-5a95e464aa13",
                                                "text": "Ik kon niet meer interrumperen, niet vloeken, niet roddelen of oordelen."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "fc26037d-3315-479d-ae8c-ea70481123e0",
                        "source_entry_id": "31ffb4bb-27e7-3486-b991-2a2c12a61a3f",
                        "source_sense_description": "chit-chat",
                        "target_lang_word": "болта́ть",
                        "target_lang_code": "ru",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "болта́ть",
                                "target_lang_code": "ru",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "5f194a5d-4d7d-3ce0-a3ec-4a772a12b9c1",
                                        "entry_id": "bbf17a47-5dd7-32d6-99d1-1d24b2dd9927",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "беспорядочно раскачивать чем-либо"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "35b006a9-997b-418e-86c4-0d063915fe41",
                                                "sense_id": "5f194a5d-4d7d-3ce0-a3ec-4a772a12b9c1",
                                                "text": "На подоконнике сидел и болтал ногами в джинсах совершенно незнакомый дядька."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "79f9f4d0-96ca-338b-a8de-16fe05943c8f",
                                        "entry_id": "bbf17a47-5dd7-32d6-99d1-1d24b2dd9927",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "устар. что-либо перемешивать, взбалтывая"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "fd13ad12-1e17-495b-962d-98753cec41ec",
                                                "sense_id": "79f9f4d0-96ca-338b-a8de-16fe05943c8f",
                                                "text": "Лита на мгновение даже перестала болтать ложкой похлёбку."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b598380a-9f0d-4eac-a2b3-e9300b2a8de2",
                                                "sense_id": "79f9f4d0-96ca-338b-a8de-16fe05943c8f",
                                                "text": "Генри мрачно болтал ложкой в чашке, и вид у него был такой несчастный, что мне стало жаль бедного ученого."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "f62ad2ae-8f9a-36f5-a576-2cd6d1ca0034",
                                        "entry_id": "bbf17a47-5dd7-32d6-99d1-1d24b2dd9927",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "разг., пренебр. то же, что болтать языком, говорить, разговаривать"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "befa667b-b31b-459a-81f0-e8cf33ced4ed",
                                                "sense_id": "f62ad2ae-8f9a-36f5-a576-2cd6d1ca0034",
                                                "text": "За рулём она вечно болтала без умолку, напоминая Нике жителя Чукотки, который едет на оленях по бескрайней тундре и поёт нескончаемую песню обо всем, что попадается ему по дороге."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "c262d3de-4d8d-31f2-8d36-7482b5f83a88",
                                        "entry_id": "bbf17a47-5dd7-32d6-99d1-1d24b2dd9927",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "разг. вести непринуждённый диалог, беседовать"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8687f0f4-7175-4c4a-842a-abc815797b28",
                                                "sense_id": "c262d3de-4d8d-31f2-8d36-7482b5f83a88",
                                                "text": "Патрульные были заняты — они болтали с хорошенькой продавщицей пива."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
